WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.140
Sell-to-us: people who want to sell to you or trade in, with details and valuation.

2
00:00:07.691 --> 00:00:11.240
Open the request and look at the details and photos.

3
00:00:11.787 --> 00:00:16.850
Set the price range under "Valuation" and click "Send the valuation".

4
00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:22.300
If accepted, click "Make a draft listing" to create a draft listing.

5
00:00:22.852 --> 00:00:29.530
Give a firm valuation only after seeing the item; give a range, not one number.
